#
#   value_parsing_5 - parsing CSS values: color-mix(), light-dark(), <color>, corner shapes,
#                     counters, <ratio> and <string>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/ValueParsing.cpp (lines 2082-2664): color-mix() (its
#       parse_component lambda is a function of its own), light-dark(), <color> (keywords,
#       functions, named and hex colors and the quirks-mode hashless hex color),
#       <corner-shape-value>, counter()/counters(), <counter-style-name>, <counter-style>, the
#       [ <integer> && <symbol> ] pair, <ratio> and <string>.
